vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381520/extras/41a988f0c37da7aa94c6cb23b671d6ce.mp4?t=1752698964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Traverse forests, explore cities, ruin a rock concert, and crash a fandom convention, all while throwing your JRPG expectations out the window. Experience a modernized take on the genre: no random encounters, a sprint feature, headbutting, and no grinding!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381520/extras/b46efe9662b6f18f960f18048fc106b9.poster.avif?t=1752698964\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381520/extras/b46efe9662b6f18f960f18048fc106b9.webm?t=1752698964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381520/extras/b46efe9662b6f18f960f18048fc106b9.mp4?t=1752698964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Recruit and travel with five new friends, customize your battle experience with six playable characters, and time your attacks to build your meter, ultimately unleashing powerful duo and trio attacks! The better you do in combat, the better the rewards you receive at the end: more XP, more items, more money!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381520/extras/6fdd8ab214eda2a857368b63f44c3d6e.poster.avif?t=1752698964\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381520/extras/6fdd8ab214eda2a857368b63f44c3d6e.webm?t=1752698964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381520/extras/6fdd8ab214eda2a857368b63f44c3d6e.mp4?t=1752698964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Freely interact with NPCs during conversations: stand there and listen to them gab, throw items at them, or just walk away. But remember your actions have consequences\u2014how you treat people in this world affects combat.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381520/extras/af31020a0852df93763f7ea335ecaeac.poster.avif?t=1752698964\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381520/extras/af31020a0852df93763f7ea335ecaeac.webm?t=1752698964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381520/extras/af31020a0852df93763f7ea335ecaeac.mp4?t=1752698964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Consult with your party members about your surroundings, how to beat enemies, or just to check in on your pals. Experience wacky and irreverent conversations and scenarios. You never know what'll happen next!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381520/extras/edc79a5ef408c5fbe967350a1bd4628d.poster.avif?t=1752698964\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381520/extras/edc79a5ef408c5fbe967350a1bd4628d.webm?t=1752698964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381520/extras/edc79a5ef408c5fbe967350a1bd4628d.mp4?t=1752698964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Full, all-new OST composed by Shane Mesa and Tomoya Tomita.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381520/extras/22bd10eb5caf904b75cbd7745120e87e.poster.avif?t=1752698964\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381520/extras/22bd10eb5caf904b75cbd7745120e87e.webm?t=1752698964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381520/extras/22bd10eb5caf904b75cbd7745120e87e.mp4?t=1752698964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Elemelons.",
    "short_description": "Cricket: Jae's Really Peculiar Game is a hand animated JRPG adventure that draws from genre classics. Join Jae as he goes on a journey with his best friends to try and fix the past in a story full of laughs, tears, and Elemelons. Engage in silly battles that involve timed hits, meter, and teamwork.",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cOn the whole, Cricket: Jae\u2019s Really Peculiar Game is a treat, and the confidence with which it approaches its frequently gut-wrenching narrative and merges it effortlessly with completely off-the-wall shenanigans is commendable, putting plenty of bigger budget competition to shame.\u201d<br>HeyPoorPlayer<br><br>\u201cSometimes, a game doesn\u2019t need to be huge or full of fancy graphics to touch your heart. Cricket: Jae\u2019s Really Peculiar Game is one of those special games. It mixes fun turn-based battles, cartoon-style art, and a deep, emotional story about a boy who wants to bring his mom back. It\u2019s funny, strange, sad, and beautiful all at once.\u201d<br>Turn Based Lovers<br><br>\u201cCricket: Jae\u2019s Really Peculiar Game has a lot of style and a lot of heart, and the people who grew up on both Earthbound and Super Mario RPG are going to find something here that scratches a hard-to-reach itch.\u201d<br>Ladies Gamers<br>",
